Creed's so gross.

1237
00:58:07.030 --> 00:58:09.510
Ryan is like, hey, I'm sorry it's distracting.

1238
00:58:10.010 --> 00:58:11.290
Angela does not approve.

1239
00:58:12.010 --> 00:58:14.190
Jenna, you and I both breastfed.

1240
00:58:14.190 --> 00:58:15.470
We both had pumps.

1241
00:58:15.470 --> 00:58:16.810
We had to pump at work.

1242
00:58:17.050 --> 00:58:19.290
But I would not have pumped in a bullpen.

1243
00:58:20.230 --> 00:58:22.010
No, I wouldn't have pumped in a bullpen.

1244
00:58:22.110 --> 00:58:23.390
I've pumped in lots of places.

1245
00:58:23.390 --> 00:58:26.510
I have pumped while driving down the road.

1246
00:58:26.890 --> 00:58:28.250
While you were driving?

1247
00:58:28.610 --> 00:58:29.830
While I was driving.

1248
00:58:30.050 --> 00:58:35.750
I had a day where I had to go to a meeting, and the traffic in Los Angeles is so bad that

1249
00:58:35.750 --> 00:58:41.270
